The key distinction is that FastAPI coordinates execution; isolated Spark workers actually execute the learner's code. We should never run arbitrary learner Python directly inside the API process.

## 2. Which execution technology should we use?

I compared the practical options based on Apache Spark's current architecture and Spark Connect documentation.&#x20;

